# No trailing slash, on purpose. `node_modules/` matches only a *directory*, so
# for six months a `node_modules` SYMLINK sat tracked in this repo (blob 8bf33bf,
# pointing at one agent sandbox's absolute path) because the ignore rule never
# looked at it. test/unit.repohygiene.test.ts holds the line.
node_modules
data/*
# Raw server dumps carry community member user IDs, so since the 2026-09-28
# public-readiness pass (TOG-8963) they stay out of the tree entirely.
# The derived CSV/aggregate tables in audit/ are the committed record; the
# collector rebuilds raw/ locally on a maintainer machine when needed.
# History before that commit still holds the old dumps — do not resurrect them.
audit/raw/
# the effort log's FORMAT is committed; the log itself is not. growth-effort.json
# is hand-kept per deployment, and `npm run review` reports an absent one as
# absent rather than scoring it as zero hours
!data/growth-effort.example.json
backups/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
# TOG-1644 staging demo artifacts. They default to a private runtime directory
# outside the checkout now, but TWO_SESSION_DEMO_* can still point at one and an
# older revision's defaults landed here. Neither the guild's member->role map nor
# a live invite should ever be one `git add -A` away from the remote.
.staging-session-demo-snapshot.json
.staging-session-demo-invite.txt
